    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You launch a mote of light at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Radiant damage, and until the end of your next turn, it emits Dim Light in a 10-foot radius and can’t benefit from the Invisible condition.",
        "Cantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8)."
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You launch a mote of light at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Radiant damage, and until the end of your next turn, it emits <a>Dim Light</a> in a 10-foot radius and can’t benefit from the <a>Invisible</a> condition.</p> <p><em><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong></em> The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).</p> </div>",
      "type": "description"
